    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Horde Wants You Dead",
    "steam_appid": 3552820,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD</strong> is a chaotic shoot'em up where you and your squad must survive against hundreds and thousands of angry and fearless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/e192724d4351cefb748ff3efd326ac4a.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your bullets flying, throw grenades at large groups, roll away from danger. Learn and adapt to different enemies. Use all the tools at your disposal to match their quickly overwhelming numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/aa8413ca92946dc12f2a13b4037ea42f.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and play in 4-player online co-op. Strategize with your squad to focus on tougher enemies or try to split up the horde around the map. Keep each other alive and you might just stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/67225f812982b4e5e2ee2d9a57043023.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full ragdoll physics for all enemies, send bodies and dismembered limbs flying through the air with a perfectly placed grenade. Watch as blood spurts out from every hit, slash and bullet hole, dynamically covering the arena. Gaze upon the scarred battlefields, littered with cracks and scorch marks - you could almost call it art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f03e626644d2eb25893b3aa1936e1e0c.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins from downed enemies to earn supply crates with a selection of upgrades. Improve your character, increase your fire power or try a new weapon. Supplies are limited so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/1f9e924117a12829e0764fda0887dd7d.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/9de02d9eb42058c3ef1fd5790b98ca0f.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/9de02d9eb42058c3ef1fd5790b98ca0f.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/9de02d9eb42058c3ef1fd5790b98ca0f.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be resilient but clumsy, hard working but selfish. Pick traits that suit your playing style or challenge yourself with a deeply flawed character. Traits come in all flavours, from simple stat modifiers to game changing mechanics.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE HORDE WANTS YOU DEAD</strong> is a chaotic shoot'em up where you and your squad must survive against hundreds and thousands of angry and fearless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/e192724d4351cefb748ff3efd326ac4a.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/123f88b7ba0e828833c0aa87abf2034a.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your bullets flying, throw grenades at large groups, roll away from danger. Learn and adapt to different enemies. Use all the tools at your disposal to match their quickly overwhelming numbers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/aa8413ca92946dc12f2a13b4037ea42f.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/3d94a72dedc56c42cfb1bc703986d478.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and play in 4-player online co-op. Strategize with your squad to focus on tougher enemies or try to split up the horde around the map. Keep each other alive and you might just stand a chance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/67225f812982b4e5e2ee2d9a57043023.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/d6d9078a7401337f5ead3fb8e98800da.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With full ragdoll physics for all enemies, send bodies and dismembered limbs flying through the air with a perfectly placed grenade. Watch as blood spurts out from every hit, slash and bullet hole, dynamically covering the arena. Gaze upon the scarred battlefields, littered with cracks and scorch marks - you could almost call it art!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f03e626644d2eb25893b3aa1936e1e0c.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/f858f28939affc3e668681581ea1a09d.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins from downed enemies to earn supply crates with a selection of upgrades. Improve your character, increase your fire power or try a new weapon. Supplies are limited so pick wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/1f9e924117a12829e0764fda0887dd7d.webp?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/9de02d9eb42058c3ef1fd5790b98ca0f.poster.avif?t=1754933369\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/9de02d9eb42058c3ef1fd5790b98ca0f.webm?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552820/extras/9de02d9eb42058c3ef1fd5790b98ca0f.mp4?t=1754933369\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be resilient but clumsy, hard working but selfish. Pick traits that suit your playing style or challenge yourself with a deeply flawed character. Traits come in all flavours, from simple stat modifiers to game changing mechanics.</p>",
